OL,3,GNEWSAStreeting denies 'kicking can down
OL,4,Athe road' in defence spending row
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as Chancellor John Healey and
OL,7,FStreeting announce that foreign firms
OL,8,Fwhich are awarded defence contracts of
OL,9,Fmore than #50m will need to invest an
OL,10,Fequal value back into the UK.
